"href=\"mailto:mrudolf@kdewebdev.org?subject=ScriptInfo\">mrudolf@kdewebdev."
"org</a><br />Project Lead - Eric Laffoon <a href=\"mailto:sequitur@kde.org?"
"subject=ScriptInfo\">sequitur@kde.org</a></p>\n"
"</body></html>\n"
